<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "any licence or exemption issued or granted under the act in respect of the licensing of commercial vehicles prior to the appointed date and expiring at any time after the appointed date shall, on the appointed date be deemed to be issued or granted under the land Public Transport act 2010 until the expiry of the licence or exemption if the licence or exemption is registered with the Commission within six months from the appointed date or within such other period as may be extended by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in this section shall be construed so as to extend the term or duration of a licence or exemption referred to in subsection (1) beyond the date of its expiry."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding the period of validity of the licence or exemption referred to in subsection (1), if it is not registered with the Commission within the period of registration under subsection (1), such licence or exemption shall lapse on the expiry of the period of registration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
