<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "a licence or exemption referred to in subsection (1) shall be subject to terms and conditions as the Commission may determine, and the provisions of the land Public Transport act 2010 relating to the revocation, suspension and renewal of licences and exemptions shall apply to all licences issued and exemptions given under the land Public Transport act 2010 pursuant to subsection (1). Status of pending applications under the Act"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
