<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_11__subsec_1__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "exemptions under any provision of the act or any subsidiary legislation made thereunder in respect of the licensing of commercial vehicles, made by any person under the act before the appointed date and pending immediately before the appointed date shall, with effect from the appointed date, be dealt with under the land Public Transport act 2010 by the Commission as if such applications had been made to it under the provisions of the land Public Transport act 2010. Status of pending appeals under the Act"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
