<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_12> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any appeal in respect of a decision made under the act was pending immediately before the appointed date before the Minister charged with the responsibility for matters relating to the licensing of commercial vehicles or where any right to appeal in respect of such decision had accrued, the proceedings in respect of the appeal or in respect of any appeal under the accrued right to appeal, shall be continued or had, as the case may be, with effect from the appointed date before the appeal Tribunal under the land Public Transport act 2010 as if those proceedings were in respect of a decision under the land Public Transport act 2010, subject to all such directions or conditions as the appeal Tribunal may deem fit or expedient to give or impose in the matter."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
