<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_10> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to the provisions of the land Public Transport act 2010, nothing in the act or the land Public Transport act 2010 shall affect any person liable to be prosecuted or punished for offences committed under the act before the appointed date, or any investigation made, proceedings brought or sentence imposed before that day in respect of such offence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
