<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the Commercial Vehicles licensing board Peninsular Malaysia, hereinafter referred to as the “dissolved board”, is dissolved."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
