<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "any person who immediately before the appointed date was employed as an officer or servant of the dissolved board shall, on the appointed date, have the right to an option to be employed by the Commission upon terms and conditions of service no less favourable than those enjoyed immediately before the appointed date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
