<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Until such time as the terms and conditions of service, including the conduct and discipline of its employees are drawn up by the Commission, the scheme and terms and conditions of service including the conduct and discipline of employees of the dissolved board, shall mutatis mutandis continue to apply to every person who has opted under subsection (6) to be employed by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
