<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "all moneys due to be paid to the dissolved board immediately before the appointed date shall become due to the Commission as from that date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@/~cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/11/eng@> .
